<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="classBpReceivePacket" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacket</ref> class is a child class of <ref refid="classBpSinkPattern" kindref="compound">BpSinkPattern</ref>. It is an app used for extracting payload data from a bundle, wrapping it into a UDP packet, and sending it.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Brian Tomko <ulink url="mailto:brian.j.tomko@nasa.gov">brian.j.tomko@nasa.gov</ulink></para>
</simplesect>
