<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="classBpSendPacket" kindref="compound">BpSendPacket</ref> class is a child class of <ref refid="classBpSourcePattern" kindref="compound">BpSourcePattern</ref>. It is an app used for extracting payload data from a (UDP) packet, wrapping it into a bundle, and sending it. It is episodic and overrides TryWaitForDataAvailable since it monitors a socket that will not always have new data. </para>
</sect1>
